{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:54 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:54 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:54 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b7110913e6c8b13bc60b04c969f1826/2026-11/002_13.png\"/><p>今日（22日）下午3時許，西環山道59號地下一間舖頭懷疑發生火警，冒出陣陣濃煙。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄，意外中無人受傷，毋須疏散。據悉，事件涉及電掣短路起火，波及雜物。</p><img alt=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3576cd3928bc43da3990dd486a1ba594/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_16_19_52_2_.jpeg\" title=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\"/><p>消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。</p><img alt=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89db0e80f468d970ccb8cd3304999109/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_16_19_52_1_.jpeg\" title=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\"/><p>消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。</p><img alt=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b18faee2e7905f08b07833d006b17a1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-22_at_16_19_52.jpeg\" title=\"消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。\"/><p>消防到場開喉灌救，迅速將火救熄。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:50.194594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:54:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:57:29.091594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:29.056775+00:00","content_hash":"4f554137aff000d00fa446fec74cc68366bec9ce50a14e82d0f316d21ca72920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}